erver.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries on HTTP 503, up to 3 attempts in total. It sleeps 0.5s after the first 503 and 1s after the second, then raises the last `HTTPError` if the third attempt also returns 503. Other HTTP errors (404, for example) are raised immediately without retrying.\n\n`attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5` are new optional constructor arguments, so existing callers behave as before.\n\nI ran it against a local test server (with `backoff=0.01` so it ran fast):\n\n| Server responses | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, 200 | succeeded | 3 |\n| 503 every time | raised `HTTPError` 503 | 3 |\n| 404 | raised `HTTPError` 404 | 1 |\n| 200 | succeeded | 1 |\n\nI didn't add a test file to the repo.\n\nOnly 503 responses are retried. Connection errors and timeouts still raise immediately.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 141427, "requests_cache_write": 36771, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1214542, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1536, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial17", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 92, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:45:46.965930+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 18.269, "t_checker_s": 2.38, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1548, "tokens_cache_read": 141427, "tokens_cache_write": 36771, "tokens_fresh": 1548, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 141427,